msgstr "在页面发布或更新后立即翻译成所有语言"

#: includes/admin-page.php:1602
msgid ""
"Visitors then get the translated page straight away instead of waiting for "
"the first translation. This uses your translation service for every enabled "
"language after each save."
msgstr ""
